OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mixture of sunny intervals
OL,6,Fand blustery showers, some of which
OL,7,Fwill be heavy and perhaps thundery,
OL,8,Fespecially over western hills in the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Winds freshening once again
OL,10,Fto give a rather cool feel to the day.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FPartly cloudy through the
OL,13,Fevening with showers gradually dying
OL,14,Fout. Becoming largely dry overnight
OL,15,Fand clear in the west, though cloudier
OL,16,Falong eastern coasts. Winds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
